# p_b3d7 — Ines goes to the office on Mondays and Thursdays

Ines is not strictly a work-from-home person; she goes to the office (the same building as Elena, or a different one) on Mondays and Thursdays, and works from the home office on Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Fridays. On her office days, her laptop, charger, pen, and headphones leave the house. On her WFH days, they are at desk_o1. Elena's routine is unchanged: out 8–17:30 every weekday. This means the office room is active on Tue/Wed/Fri for Ines, and on Mon/Thu it is empty (or only holds the plant pot). In the evening both are home. Weekend errands 12–14 for both.

What sets this apart: laptop_ines is OUT_OF_HOUSE on Monday and Thursday weekdays but at desk_o1 on Tue/Wed/Fri. What would refute it: laptop_ines found at desk_o1 on a Monday or Thursday, or found OUT_OF_HOUSE on a Wednesday.

