# p_8f2b — Early departure at 7:15, Ines on the office floor (fork of p_d1e5)

Fork of p_d1e5. The parent had Ines's laptop at desk_o1; the one sighting places it on floor_o_o1. Ines works from the office floor, not the desk. The early-bird timing is retained: Elena is out the door at 7:15 on weekdays, so her keys, jacket, backpack, and laptop leave the house by 7:20. Ines is up at 5:45, makes breakfast, settles onto the office floor by 8:00, and works until 17:00.

What changed from the parent: laptop_ines, headphones_ines, charger_ines, and pen_ines all moved from desk_o1 to floor_o_o1. The claim about Ines's laptop now targets floor_o_o1.

