# p_c4d9 — Elena commutes; Ines works from the office floor and never leaves

Ines is a work-from-home freelancer who never steps outside during the week. She sits on the office floor (floor_o_o1) from 9:00 to 17:30, laptop, charger, pen, and headphones all within arm's reach on the floor. Her keys stay on the entry table all day because she has no reason to go out. Elena, by contrast, commutes to her office in town from 8:00 to 17:30, taking her laptop, keys, wallet, jacket, and backpack.

What sets this apart from p_a3f7 and p_3e7a: Ines's keys are ALWAYS at entry_table_e1 (she never leaves), and her laptop is on floor_o_o1 (not desk_o1). What sets it apart from p_c9d4: Ines's laptop does NOT go out of the house at midday; she eats at the kitchen table or the office floor. What sets it apart from p_b8c2: Elena's things DO leave the house.

